# Eluge, the Shoreless Sea reduces "the first instant or sorcery spell you cast each turn" (CR 601.2f): a creature spell is not
# reduced, and casting one first does not use up the first instant or sorcery. Turn 3: Eluge (Black Lotus and an Island) floods
